{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\n\t\t\t警方呼籲市民提供一名在屯門失蹤男子的消息。<br/>\n<br/>\n77歲男子鄒華順昨日下午在青楊街最後露面後便告失蹤，家人同日報案。他身高約1.68米，體重約52公斤，瘦身材，尖面型，黃皮膚及蓄短白髮。最後露面時身穿黑色上衣、黑色長褲、啡色外套及黑色鞋。<br/>\n<br/>\n任何人如有該失蹤男子的消息或曾見過他，請與警方聯絡。<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n編輯：譚佩貞\t\t</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-17T04:48:19.346049+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":150,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-17T04:13:23+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-17T06:02:42.159697+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-17T04:41:52.456295+00:00","content_hash":"553c356d0f6cef4c1cb600a784475ae9ae246971c91e4956b15c7b9a2b24ff62","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}